sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant REST as OVMS REST<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant gRPC as OVMS gRPC<br/>8001/TCP gRPC
    participant MediaPipe as MediaPipe Graph<br/>(in-process)
    participant OV as OpenVINO Runtime<br/>(in-process)
    participant GenAI as OpenVINO GenAI<br/>(in-process)
    participant S3 as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 1: Model Inference (REST via RHOAI)
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OpenShift OAuth)
    Ingress->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>TLS
    KRBAC->>REST: Proxy to OVMS<br/>HTTP plaintext (localhost)
    REST->>OV: Execute inference<br/>(in-process)
    OV-->>REST: Prediction result
    REST-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Ingress: Response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: Model Inference (gRPC direct)
    Client->>gRPC: ModelInfer RPC<br/>gRPC plaintext
    gRPC->>OV: Execute inference<br/>(in-process)
    OV-->>gRPC: Inference result
    gRPC-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: LLM Chat Completion (OpenAI API)
    Client->>REST: POST /v3/chat/completions<br/>Auth: API Key (optional)
    REST->>MediaPipe: HttpLLMCalculator<br/>(in-process)
    MediaPipe->>GenAI: ContinuousBatchingPipeline<br/>(in-process)
    GenAI->>OV: Token generation<br/>(in-process)
    OV-->>GenAI: Generated tokens
    GenAI-->>MediaPipe: Token stream
    MediaPipe-->>REST: SSE chunks
    REST-->>Client: HTTP chunked/SSE stream

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 4: Model Loading from Cloud Storage
    REST->>S3: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / access key
    S3-->>REST: Model files

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 5: HuggingFace Model Pull
    REST->>HF: git clone model repo<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HF-->>REST: Model repository contents
    Note right of REST: Saved to /mnt/models
